      "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We’re seeking a Contract Recruiting Coordinator to join our team, focusing on supporting the logistics and coordination of the recruiting efforts for OpenAI.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>In this role, you will:</strong></p><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Act as point of contact for candidates; coordinating, scheduling, and managing interviews as well as travel and accommodation arrangements when needed. Making sure everyone is in the right place at the right time.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Use Ashby (our ATS) and relevant recruiting tools to stay organized and help keep our busy team on track.</p></li><p>[…]</p>",
